{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dante's 9 is a roguelite action-platformer fused with a deckbuilder, where you use powerful cards in real time combat encounters. Customize and upgrade your cards to battle through the depths of the underworld as Dante the cat. Can you reach the 9th circle before its too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real time combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/fd018f417dd70efdd0409bbb4b291ed0.poster.avif?t=1771710640\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/fd018f417dd70efdd0409bbb4b291ed0.webm?t=1771710640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/fd018f417dd70efdd0409bbb4b291ed0.mp4?t=1771710640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay your way through the nine circles of Hell with real-time card-based combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deckbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/0db75d762a669c02359d5b5ec0cf431b.poster.avif?t=1771710640\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/0db75d762a669c02359d5b5ec0cf431b.webm?t=1771710640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/0db75d762a669c02359d5b5ec0cf431b.mp4?t=1771710640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a uniquely powerful deck each run to defeat the horrors of the underworld!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique sticker customization system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/05712702847ea973915ce7e06f0575f0.poster.avif?t=1771710640\" width=1170 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/05712702847ea973915ce7e06f0575f0.webm?t=1771710640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/05712702847ea973915ce7e06f0575f0.mp4?t=1771710640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your deck by applying stickers for insane combos and synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable cards with unique sticker system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cat styles to change your experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable decks that alter gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Unique biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow button</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293350?t=1771710640","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/ed51a8942719c62710844182b2a39a02ea49246f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771710640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/50f5953ff195e3c1c07e54ff28f22ad6c723c210/capsule_231x87.